B.b5U=new A.w("love","I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.b9C=new A.w("love","Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.be6=new A.w("love","Deep riddle #3 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.bjv=new A.w("love","I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.bgW=new A.w("love","Challenge 5: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.bcB=new A.w("bible","Deep riddle #6 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I?","The great fish")
B.bfN=new A.w("bible","Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I? (Think carefully.)","Noah's ark")
B.b5V=new A.w("bible","I parted for a nation fleeing; walls of me stood like guards then fell flat. What am I?","The Red Sea")
B.bgH=new A.w("bible","Deep riddle #9 \u2014 Small in hand, giant on the field; one smooth stone ended my echo. What am I?","Goliath's challenge")
B.b7E=new A.w("bible","Challenge 10: I burned yet was not consumed; a bush spoke from within me. What am I?","The burning bush")
B.bif=new A.w("street","I speak without a mouth on every corner; ignore me and pay a fine. What am I?","A traffic sign")
B.b5I=new A.w("street","Deep riddle #12 \u2014 I change color but never mood; red stops, green releases. What am I?","A stoplight")
B.bdY=new A.w("street","Rolling on four yet carrying hundreds; I stop every block but never walk. What am I?","A city bus")
B.beY=new A.w("street","I am tagged in spray paint yet tell stories the city tries to erase. What am I? (Think carefully.)","Graffiti")
B.bap=new A.w("street","Challenge 15: Sold from a window with no door; hunger knows my bell. What am I?","A food truck")
B.bey=new A.w("church","I rise toward heaven yet stand on earth; bells call the faithful to me. What am I?","A steeple")
B.b6D=new A.w("church","Passed hand to hand yet never owned; peace lives in my circle. What am I?","The sign of peace")
B.bcX=new A.w("church","Deep riddle #18 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.bdE=new A.w("church","Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.bjI=new A.w("church","Challenge 20: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.bew=new A.w("logic","Deep riddle #21 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A hole")
B.bgl=new A.w("logic","I have cities but no houses, forests but no trees, water but no fish. What am I?","A map")
